  characterId: gunslinger
  displayName: GUNSLINGER
  subtitle: One Shot, One Distance
  role: RANGED
  flavorText: 'Twin pistols, a single sharp line of fire.

    She wins the fight
    before it ever

    closes in - but let an enemy through,

    and she has no
    answer for it.'
